{
  "$schema": "https://xnsteam-ai.github.io/Html-library/r/schema.json",
  "name": "section-lead-form",
  "title": "Lead Gen Form",
  "description": "A long-form informational page — savings, benefits and contractor copy — ending in a multi-fieldset request form with a real radio-scale question. Auto-height, so nothing is clipped.",
  "category": "sites",
  "type": "html",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "tailwind": "^4.0.0",
  "tags": [
    "form",
    "lead gen",
    "landing",
    "long-form"
  ],
  "surface": "section",
  "files": [
    {
      "path": "section-lead-form.html",
      "type": "html",
      "content": "<!--\n  Lead Form — a long-form info page ending in a multi-fieldset request form.\n  Radio-scale answers, a select and validated required inputs are all real\n  controls; nothing here needs JavaScript to work.\n-->\n<section class=\"w-full bg-[#e9ecef] py-8 dark:bg-neutral-950\">\n  <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1000px] overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-white shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] dark:bg-neutral-900\">\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"border-b-4 border-amber-500 bg-white px-6 py-6 text-center dark:bg-neutral-900\">\n      <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\">Go Green California</span>\n      <p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">Home Solar Power Solutions</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Nav -->\n    <nav class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center bg-emerald-700 dark:bg-emerald-800\">\n      <a href=\"#lf-savings\" class=\"px-6 py-3.5 text-[14px] font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-emerald-900\">Savings</a>\n      <a href=\"#lf-benefits\" class=\"px-6 py-3.5 text-[14px] font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-emerald-900\">Benefits</a>\n      <a href=\"#lf-contractors\" class=\"px-6 py-3.5 text-[14px] font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-emerald-900\">Contractors</a>\n      <a href=\"#lf-request\" class=\"px-6 py-3.5 text-[14px] font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-emerald-900\">Request Info</a>\n    </nav>\n\n    <main class=\"p-8\">\n      <section id=\"lf-savings\" class=\"mb-10 border-b border-gray-200 pb-5 dark:border-white/10\">\n        <h2 class=\"mb-3 text-[19px] font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\">Solar Power Can Save You Money</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">\n          In the next 10 years, the average California homeowner will spend over $14,000 on electricity. Electricity prices in California have increased 50% since 1990, and continue to increase approximately 3–4% each year. If your average electric bill is $150 or more per month, solar power in California can save you over $1,250 each year.\n        </p>\n        <h2 class=\"mb-3 mt-6 text-[19px] font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\">California Solar Rebates and Tax Incentives</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">\n          A large number of California solar rebate programs and financial options exist to make it easier to afford solar power for your home. Wherever you live in the state, there is a rebate or incentive that will help make solar power a reality for you.\n        </p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section id=\"lf-benefits\" class=\"mb-10 border-b border-gray-200 pb-5 dark:border-white/10\">\n        <h2 class=\"mb-3 text-[19px] font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\">Home Solar Benefits</h2>\n        <p class=\"mb-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">There are a number of benefits of home solar power:</p>\n        <ul class=\"space-y-3\">\n          <li class=\"rounded-r border-l-[5px] border-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 p-3.5 text-[14.5px] text-gray-800 dark:border-emerald-500 dark:bg-emerald-500/10 dark:text-gray-200\">\n            <strong>1.</strong> Solar systems can lower your electric bills by 70% or more. Homeowners may no longer have to pay thousands of dollars each year to their utility companies.\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"rounded-r border-l-[5px] border-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 p-3.5 text-[14.5px] text-gray-800 dark:border-emerald-500 dark:bg-emerald-500/10 dark:text-gray-200\">\n            <strong>2.</strong> Current government rebates and incentives might save you nearly 50% off the price of solar roofs and shingles.\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"rounded-r border-l-[5px] border-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 p-3.5 text-[14.5px] text-gray-800 dark:border-emerald-500 dark:bg-emerald-500/10 dark:text-gray-200\">\n            <strong>3.</strong> Installing a solar panel system can increase the value of your home by $20,000 to $40,000.\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"rounded-r border-l-[5px] border-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 p-3.5 text-[14.5px] text-gray-800 dark:border-emerald-500 dark:bg-emerald-500/10 dark:text-gray-200\">\n            <strong>4.</strong> Many California solar companies are offering great financing programs so you can get solar for as little as $0 down.\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n\n      <section id=\"lf-contractors\" class=\"mb-10 border-b border-gray-200 pb-5 dark:border-white/10\">\n        <h2 class=\"mb-3 text-[19px] font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\">Certified California Solar Contractors</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">\n          Installing solar panels on your home is a substantial investment: make a payment now and get a big return in the future. Go Green California can help you feel comfortable that you are getting quotes from the best solar energy installers in the state.\n        </p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section id=\"lf-request\">\n        <h2 class=\"mb-3 text-[19px] font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\">Request More Information</h2>\n        <p class=\"mb-4 text-[15px] text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">\n          Please fill out the form below to see how alternative energy can benefit your home. <em>All fields are required.</em>\n        </p>\n\n        <form class=\"rounded-md border border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 p-6 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/5\">\n          <fieldset class=\"mb-5 rounded border border-gray-300 bg-white p-5 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-neutral-900\">\n            <legend class=\"px-2.5 text-[14px] font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\">Contact Information</legend>\n            <div class=\"mb-4\">\n              <label for=\"lf-fullName\" class=\"mb-1 block text-[13.5px] font-bold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">Full Name:</label>\n              <input id=\"lf-fullName\" type=\"text\" required class=\"w-full rounded border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-emerald-700 dark:border-white/15 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-gray-100\" />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mb-4\">\n              <label for=\"lf-address\" class=\"mb-1 block text-[13.5px] font-bold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">Mailing Address:</label>\n              <input id=\"lf-address\" type=\"text\" required class=\"w-full rounded border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-emerald-700 dark:border-white/15 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-gray-100\" />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mb-4\">\n              <label for=\"lf-phone\" class=\"mb-1 block text-[13.5px] font-bold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">Phone Number:</label>\n              <input id=\"lf-phone\" type=\"tel\" required class=\"w-full rounded border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-emerald-700 dark:border-white/15 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-gray-100\" />\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <label for=\"lf-email\" class=\"mb-1 block text-[13.5px] font-bold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">Email Address:</label>\n              <input id=\"lf-email\" type=\"email\" required class=\"w-full rounded border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-emerald-700 dark:border-white/15 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-gray-100\" />\n            </div>\n          </fieldset>\n\n          <fieldset class=\"mb-5 rounded border border-gray-300 bg-white p-5 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-neutral-900\">\n            <legend class=\"px-2.5 text-[14px] font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\">Household Details</legend>\n            <div class=\"mb-4\">\n              <label for=\"lf-homeSize\" class=\"mb-1 block text-[13.5px] font-bold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">Home Size (sq. ft.):</label>\n              <input id=\"lf-homeSize\" type=\"number\" placeholder=\"e.g. 2000\" required class=\"w-full rounded border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-emerald-700 dark:border-white/15 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-gray-100\" />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mb-4\">\n              <label for=\"lf-income\" class=\"mb-1 block text-[13.5px] font-bold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">Household Income:</label>\n              <select id=\"lf-income\" required class=\"w-full rounded border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-emerald-700 dark:border-white/15 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-gray-100\">\n                <option value=\"\" disabled selected>-- Select Income Range --</option>\n                <option>Under $50,000</option>\n                <option>$50,000 – $100,000</option>\n                <option>$100,000 – $150,000</option>\n                <option>Over $150,000</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <label for=\"lf-electricBill\" class=\"mb-1 block text-[13.5px] font-bold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">Average Monthly Electric Bill ($):</label>\n              <input id=\"lf-electricBill\" type=\"number\" placeholder=\"0.00\" required class=\"w-full rounded border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-emerald-700 dark:border-white/15 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-gray-100\" />\n            </div>\n          </fieldset>\n\n          <fieldset class=\"mb-5 rounded border border-gray-300 bg-white p-5 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-neutral-900\">\n            <legend class=\"px-2.5 text-[14px] font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\">Additional Information</legend>\n            <div class=\"mb-4\">\n              <label for=\"lf-awareness\" class=\"mb-1 block text-[13.5px] font-bold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">How did you learn about us?</label>\n              <select id=\"lf-awareness\" required class=\"w-full rounded border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-emerald-700 dark:border-white/15 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-gray-100\">\n                <option value=\"\" disabled selected>-- Select Source --</option>\n                <option>Search Engine</option>\n                <option>Social Media</option>\n                <option>Friend or Family</option>\n                <option>Advertisement</option>\n                <option>Other</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <span class=\"mb-1.5 block text-[13.5px] font-bold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">Interest in installing alternative energy (0 = Low, 5 = High):</span>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\">\n                  <input id=\"lf-interest0\" type=\"radio\" name=\"lf-interest\" value=\"0\" required />\n                  <label for=\"lf-interest0\" class=\"text-[13px] text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">0</label>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\">\n                  <input id=\"lf-interest1\" type=\"radio\" name=\"lf-interest\" value=\"1\" />\n                  <label for=\"lf-interest1\" class=\"text-[13px] text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">1</label>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\">\n                  <input id=\"lf-interest2\" type=\"radio\" name=\"lf-interest\" value=\"2\" />\n                  <label for=\"lf-interest2\" class=\"text-[13px] text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">2</label>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\">\n                  <input id=\"lf-interest3\" type=\"radio\" name=\"lf-interest\" value=\"3\" checked />\n                  <label for=\"lf-interest3\" class=\"text-[13px] text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">3</label>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\">\n                  <input id=\"lf-interest4\" type=\"radio\" name=\"lf-interest\" value=\"4\" />\n                  <label for=\"lf-interest4\" class=\"text-[13px] text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">4</label>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\">\n                  <input id=\"lf-interest5\" type=\"radio\" name=\"lf-interest\" value=\"5\" />\n                  <label for=\"lf-interest5\" class=\"text-[13px] text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">5</label>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </fieldset>\n\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full rounded bg-amber-500 py-3 text-[15px] font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-amber-600\">\n            Submit Request\n          </button>\n        </form>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer class=\"bg-neutral-800 px-6 py-5 text-center text-[13px] text-white\">\n      <p>Go Green California is a no-cost, no-obligation, risk-free service dedicated to providing information to anyone interested in lowering their electricity bill and going green.</p>\n      <p class=\"mt-1.5\">© 2026 Green California Initiative</p>\n    </footer>\n  </div>\n</section>\n"
    }
  ]
}
